		{"id":"5e","type":"text","text":"### 🚨 FAILED State\n**Fatal Bootstrap Panic [5e]**\n* Unrecoverable error handling. Logs structural failures, saves state history, and terminates execution safely.","x":940,"y":778,"width":420,"height":185},
		{"id":"2a","type":"text","text":"### 📦 Bootstrap Container\n**Dependency Injection Core [2a]**\n`bootstrap.py:467`\n`python\\nreturn await bootstrap.build_app_container(\\n`","x":-300,"y":-750,"width":450,"height":187},
		{"id":"2b","type":"text","text":"### 🛠️ Register Core Services\n**Foundational Infrastructure [2b]**\n`bootstrap.py:299`\n`python\\nself.registry.register_core_services(self.container)\\n`\n* Registers infrastructure, legacy providers, and lifecycle hooks.","x":-300,"y":-530,"width":450,"height":260},
		{"id":"2c","type":"text","text":"### 📐 Build Dependency Graph\n**Resolve relationships [2c]**\n`bootstrap.py:307`\n`python\\nself.container.build_graph()\\n`","x":-300,"y":-230,"width":450,"height":160},
		{"id":"2d","type":"text","text":"### 🛰️ Orchestrator Startup\n**Phased Execution Engine [2d]**\n`runtime_orchestrator.py:232`\n`python\\nawait orchestrator.startup()\\n`\n* Sequences: CORE → COMM → CONTROL → MONITOR → COGNITION → SHELL","x":-300,"y":-30,"width":450,"height":215},
		{"id":"2e","type":"text","text":"### ⏱️ Execute Startup Phase\n**Evaluator Block [2e]**\n`runtime_orchestrator.py:237`\n`python\\nawait self._execute_phase(phase)\\n`\n* Validates dependencies\n* Invokes `_start_service()` & DI wrapper","x":-300,"y":210,"width":450,"height":220},
		{"id":"2f","type":"text","text":"### 🏁 Start All Modules\n**Deterministic Module Registry [2f]**\n`runtime_orchestrator.py:412`\n`python\\nawait self.module_registry.start_all()\\n`","x":-300,"y":455,"width":450,"height":180},
		{"id":"1a","type":"text","text":"### 🚀 CLI Entry Point\n**main() entry point [1a]**\n`launcher.py:228`\n`python\\nlauncher = ModernLauncher()\\nlauncher.start()`","x":-900,"y":-756,"width":450,"height":200},
		{"id":"1b","type":"text","text":"### 🧭 Launcher Entry Point\n**Start Launcher [1b]**\n`launcher.py:229`\n`python\\nawait launcher.start()`","x":-900,"y":-501,"width":450,"height":155},
		{"id":"1d","type":"text","text":"### ⚡ Start Event Bus\n**Initialize Communication [1d]**\n`launcher.py:136`\n`python\\nawait bus.start()\\n`","x":-900,"y":-30,"width":450,"height":164},
		{"id":"1e","type":"text","text":"### 💬 Create Chat Application\n**Instantiate core logic [1e]**\n`launcher.py:149`\n`python\\nself.app = ChatApp()\\n`","x":-900,"y":170,"width":450,"height":170},
		{"id":"1f","type":"text","text":"### 🔄 Run Main Loop\n**Begin interaction cycle [1f]**\n`launcher.py:186`\n`python\\nawait self.app.run()\\n`","x":-900,"y":395,"width":450,"height":185},
		{"id":"3a","type":"text","text":"### 🔗 Publisher-Subscriber Backbone\n**Event Bus Base [3a]**\n* Decouples messaging across dozens of asynchronous modules.\n* Features built-in circuit breakers and priority routing layers.","x":300,"y":-750,"width":450,"height":229},
		{"id":"3b","type":"text","text":"### 🗃️ Process Pending Subscriptions\n**Deferred Boot Registration [3b]**\n* Pulls early subscriptions deferred during initial python module imports.","x":300,"y":-480,"width":450,"height":180},
		{"id":"3c","type":"text","text":"### 📊 Sort Handlers by Priority\n**Execution Queue Ordering [3c]**\n* Determines clear precedence chains before runtime loops accept ticks.","x":300,"y":-240,"width":450,"height":175},
		{"id":"3d","type":"text","text":"### 🔊 Emit Event\n**Event Engine Run [3d]**\n* System fires events without knowing structural down-stream consumers.","x":300,"y":5,"width":450,"height":180},
		{"id":"3e","type":"text","text":"### 🔔 Input Received Handler\n**Pipeline Link [3e]**\n* Captures inputs from external boundaries and hands them off directly to the parsing stream.","x":300,"y":290,"width":450,"height":165},
		{"id":"4a","type":"text","text":"### 📥 Process Raw Input\n**Boundary Gateway [4a]**\n* Intercepts incoming user messages immediately.","x":910,"y":-745,"width":450,"height":145},
		{"id":"4b","type":"text","text":"### 🧹 Normalizes Input\n**Sanitizer Block [4b]**\n* Strips whitespace, evaluates command markers, and structures text.","x":910,"y":-560,"width":450,"height":180},
		{"id":"4c","type":"text","text":"### 🖼️ Create Request Context\n**State Factory [4c]**\n* Generates request objects packed with metadata, timestamps, and caller properties.","x":910,"y":-340,"width":450,"height":200},
		{"id":"4d","type":"text","text":"### ⚡ Route to Reflex\n**Fast-Path Routing [4d]**\n* Catches hardcoded commands or cached matches without waking massive LLMs.","x":910,"y":-80,"width":450,"height":180},
		{"id":"4e","type":"text","text":"### 🧠 Route to SLM\n**Mid-Tier Intelligence Routing [4e]**\n* Diverts local, low-latency calls to small, specialized local on-device models.","x":910,"y":200,"width":450,"height":180},
		{"id":"4f","type":"text","text":"### 🌐 Route to LLM\n**Deep Cognition Path [4f]**\n* Targets large cloud/local models for intricate, multi-turn dialogue planning.","x":910,"y":460,"width":450,"height":160},
		{"id":"5a","type":"text","text":"### 🕵️ Crash Detection and Logging\n**Boot Protection Monitor [5a]**\n* Evaluates historical boot metrics\n* Guards system configuration states at initial engine loading.","x":-900,"y":760,"width":420,"height":220},
		{"id":"5f","type":"text","text":"### 🛑 Graceful Shutdown Sequence\n**Clean Exit Pipeline [5f]**\n* Intercepts terminal signals → Unwinds the live Event Bus → Flushes Memory → Sets state to `STOPPED`.","x":-900,"y":1020,"width":2260,"height":100},
		{"id":"5b","type":"text","text":"### ⚠️ Check Safe Mode Fallback\n**Loop Breaker Engine [5b]**\n* Evaluates repeat boot crashes. If active loops are detected, it overrides standard startups and forces safe configurations.","x":-440,"y":760,"width":420,"height":220},
		{"id":"5c","type":"text","text":"### 🛡️ SAFE_MODE State\n**Critical Error Recovery [5c]**\n* Isolates core systems, cuts failing optional plugins, and retains UI debug facilities.","x":20,"y":778,"width":420,"height":185},
		{"id":"5d","type":"text","text":"### 🛑 DEGRADED State\n**Graceful Degradation [5d]**\n* Triggered when optional components crash while keeping basic chat loops operational.","x":480,"y":778,"width":420,"height":185},
		{"id":"1c","type":"text","text":"### ⚙️ Initialization Sequence\n**Set Booting State [1c]**\n`launcher.py:82`\n`python\nself.state_store.set_state(\nRuntimeState.BOOTING, \nreason=\\\"Application startup initiated\\\"\n)`","x":-900,"y":-300,"width":450,"height":220}
